+
+- **Before fix:** full-recall p95 was **10.27 ms**.
+- **Fix:** drop terms with document frequency `df > n/3`, and use a Zipf-distributed vocabulary for term selection.
+- **After fix:** full-recall p95 dropped to **1.82 ms**.
